@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName Times New Roman
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
title Figure 2.4(b)  Background planning and failure outcomes
hide footbox
participant "Frontend" as P0
participant "Projects API" as P1
participant "Background" as P2
participant "Specialist" as P3
participant "Harness" as P4
participant "Local model" as P5
participant "Compiler" as P6
participant "Persistence" as P7
activate P1
P0 -> P1 : POST /{id}/analyze
P1 -> P7 : save_project(ANALYZING)
activate P2
P1 ->> P2 : create_task(background)
P1 -->> P0 : status: started
deactivate P1
loop [next specialist while preceding output valid]
activate P3
P2 -> P3 : analyze(state)
activate P4
P3 -> P4 : execute(context)
activate P5
P4 -> P5 : generate(prompt)
P5 -->> P4 : JSON / model error
deactivate P5
P4 -> P4 : Schema + lint + bounded retries
P4 -->> P3 : HarnessResult / exception
deactivate P4
P3 -->> P2 : Validated output / failure
deactivate P3
P2 -> P7 : [success] save + emit_event
end
activate P1
P1 -> P7 : events_after(project, sequence)
P7 -->> P1 : Stored event rows
P1 ->> P0 : SSE: agent progress
deactivate P1
P2 -> P2 : ConflictResolver; FinalArchitect if no conflicts
alt [no exception]
activate P6
P2 -> P6 : [no conflicts] compile_model(...)
activate P5
P6 -> P5 : Generate + validate sections
P5 -->> P6 : Section JSON / error
deactivate P5
P6 -->> P2 : Validated BuildSpec
deactivate P6
P2 -> P7 : Save; BUILD_SPEC_COMPILED + PIPELINE_COMPLETED
else [failure / conflicts]
P2 -> P7 : Persist stop status + failure event
end
deactivate P2
P1 ->> P0 : SSE: completion / stop events
note over P0,P7
API /stream reads events_after() and emits SSE; emit_event appends events, signals waiters and saves snapshots.
end note
@enduml
